id: overflowing-power
name: Overflowing Power
type: awakening
subtype: lesser
origin: mind
racial: Any
# An Adversary Transformation (dbu-rpg.com/adversary-transformations/). Said, not enforced, like every Prerequisite.
prerequisites: This character is an Adversary
tier: 1+
maxStacks: 3
aspects:
bonuses: AG +1, FO +1, TE +1, MA +1
description: >
  You are overflowing with an immense power far beyond that of the normal warrior.
text: >
  You are overflowing with an immense power far beyond that of the normal warrior.

  Racial Requirement: Any / Transformation Type: Awakening / Awakening Type: Lesser / Awakening Origin: Mind / Prerequisite(s): This character is an Adversary / Maximum No of Stacks: 3 / Tier of Power Requirement. 1+
  AG +1 · FO +1 · TE +1 · SC – · IN – · MA +1 · PE –

  Antagonistic Power: You are teeming with amazing power and seemingly endless amounts of energy.
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase your Wound Rolls, Soak Value, and Surgency by Z(T).
  (2)-[Passive]: For each time you have taken this Awakening, increase your Narrative Stamina by PCC(bT).
  (3)-[PCC/Encounter]: As an Instant Maneuver, you may spend an Adversary Action to use a Surge of your choice.
  (4)-[Triggered/Start of Combat Round, Z/Encounter]: Use a Standard Maneuver with an Action Cost of 1 Action as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.

